ROUTE GROUP "/v1" prefixes the routes inside it (Requirement 7.7).

### prefixed static route
GET /v1/ping
=> 200

{"pong": true}

### prefixed route with a path parameter
GET /v1/ghosts/7
=> 200

{"id": "7"}

### the unprefixed path is not registered
GET /ping
=> 404

{"error": "ROUTE NOT FOUND IN THIS REALM"}
